OL,3,GNEWSATiny wild cat settles in at custom
OL,4,Aenclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA male rusty-spotted cat has taken his
OL,7,Ffirst steps in his new purpose-built
OL,8,Fenclosure.
OL,10,FKuda, who weighs less than 2.2lb (1kg),
OL,11,Fbecame the first occupant of the 16ft
OL,12,F(5m)-high outdoor enclosure at The Big
OL,13,FCat Sanctuary in Smarden, Kent.
OL,15,FThe project is part of conservation
OL,16,Fefforts for the "near-threatened"
OL,17,Fanimal, which is the world's smallest
OL,18,Fwild cat species.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
