OL,3,GNEWSATiny wild cat settles in at custom
OL,4,Aenclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Over the past week of close monitoring
OL,7,Fhe has really warmed up to his
OL,8,Fsurroundings and is now exploring with
OL,9,Fhis usual confidence," said the
OL,10,Fsanctuary's Ian Jones.
